VALUES (634834, 'tt7436726', NULL, 'Jolene', 'Jolene', 'movie', 2018, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yO7Ki0M6MXkDm4Ung0aRiaH8Eyn.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aieudwnUmolG4riPytZAy1RJJKg.jpg', 'Jolene is a woman who earns her living by working behind the bar in a strip club, who calls football hooligans her family and who has made choices that still haunt her. But she has a plan. Director Elza Jo van Reenen embarked on a three-year adventure with Jolene and closely followed the rollercoaster of Jolene''s life. The result is an intimate portrait of an adrenaline junk who - despite everything - chooses not to ruin herself, but to follow her dream.', NULL, NULL, 1.5615, 6.0, 0, 9.54, '2026-10-31 23:47:58', '2026-10-31 23:47:58')
