VALUES (26682, 'tt0111002', NULL, 'Roadracers', 'Roadracers', 'movie', 1994, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPU1900ifMJMxjtBYFZytuyjitK.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cAgmH0U8tdRUMC2c9rfTXlKhmZh.jpg', 'In the 1950s, guitar-playing drifter Dude Delaney wanders into a quiet town looking to play music and generally cause trouble, much to the chagrin of the local sheriff, known as Sarge. While palling around with his B-movie-obsessed friend Nixer, Dude meets the beautiful Donna, and is offered a position in a rockabilly band, but the sheriff is intent on getting rid of him by any means necessary.', NULL, NULL, 1.3225, 5.9, 0, 9.01, '2026-10-31 23:47:58', '2026-10-31 23:47:58')
