VALUES (1734, 'tt0209163', NULL, 'The Mummy Returns', 'The Mummy Returns', 'movie', 2001, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdJsW7hcy1lrj7tdMPycTAQPAiR.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7s7WkAFPBsMTprYMbqbgKoppQsR.jpg', 'Rick and Evelyn O’Connell, along with their 8-year-old son Alex, discover the key to the legendary Scorpion King’s might: the fabled Bracelet of Anubis. Unfortunately, a newly resurrected Imhotep has designs on the bracelet as well, and isn’t above kidnapping its new bearer, Alex, to gain control of Anubis’s otherworldly army.', NULL, NULL, 13.0667, 6.419, 0, 18.752, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-31 23:47:58')
