VALUES (25237, 'tt0091251', NULL, 'Come and See', 'Иди и смотри', 'movie', 1985, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNbMsKVzigERgJUbwf8pKyZogpb.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Na31ta8vDuKOgQuPLdSZLs8bCB.jpg', 'The invasion of a village in Belarus by German forces sends young Flyora into the forest to join the weary Resistance fighters, against his family''s wishes. There he meets a girl, Glasha, who accompanies him back to his village. On returning home, Flyora finds his family and fellow peasants massacred. His continued survival amidst the brutal debris of war becomes increasingly nightmarish, a battle between despair and hope.', NULL, NULL, 9.9179, 8.187, 0, 4.74483720930232522e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-31 23:47:58')
