VALUES (12429, 'tt0876563', NULL, 'Ponyo', '崖の上のポニョ', 'movie', 2008, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp8vEZflGynlEylxEesbYasc06i.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1QmEcK0w2Ub4Hm094fHbZT8vA7o.jpg', 'When Sosuke, a young boy who lives on a clifftop overlooking the sea, rescues a stranded goldfish named Ponyo, he discovers more than he bargained for. Ponyo is a curious, energetic young creature who yearns to be human, but even as she causes chaos around the house, her father, a powerful sorcerer, schemes to return Ponyo to the sea.', NULL, NULL, 15.0041, 7.76, 0, 33.663, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-31 23:47:58')
